{"id": "msg_9af1462ce51f4f42944279444ef35f11", "role": "assistant", "parts": [{"type": "text", "text": "收到“提交并推送”。我会先按仓库的 worktree 与提交规则核对当前分支、远端和已有未提交内容，再只提交本次范围；保留原先的 4% 股息门槛改动及其他脏文件。"}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_e653b4381a1b4426979185cb77aa5b54|fc_0638dcd3f8988d29016af95375483087d28ec07546a84bc7e4", "tool_name": "skill", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"name": "repo-safety"}}], "created_at": "2026-11-15T06:38:45.743Z", "peer_id": "github.com-tyvt-financial-data-lake"}
{"id": "msg_3cdf6fba66c5400b9e027ee28d4adfea", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_e653b4381a1b4426979185cb77aa5b54|fc_0638dcd3f8988d29016af95375483087d28ec07546a84bc7e4", "tool_name": "skill", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"<skill_content name=\\\"repo-safety\\\">\\n<skill_resources>\\nBase directory for this skill: C:\\\\Users\\\\Administrator\\\\.dsh\\\\skills\\\\repo-safety\\nResolve relative paths mentioned by this skill against the base directory before using them. Load referenced resources only as needed.\\n</skill_resources>\\n\\n<skill_instructions>\\n# 仓库安全\\n\\n## Worktree\\n\\n1. 会形成提交的代码改动放在独立 worktree，不直接改主工作区分支。文档和 agent 规则，或用户明确要求在主分支做时除外。\\n2. 开工先 `git worktree list`，再看已有 `*-wt-*` 的状态。每个任务新建自己的 worktree，不复用别人未提交的目录。\\n3. 用户说「在主分支做 / 别碰某个 worktree」时照做，不进入、不合并、不删除那个目录。\\n4. 验证通过后合并回原分支，再 `git worktree remove`。先提交推送，最后才回写禅道。\\n\\n## 零填充\\n\\n`D:\\\\repository\\\\skills` 及记忆快照提交前，暂存文件不得含大量 NUL。逐路径暂存，不用 `git add -A`。写完读回开头，确认是正常文本。已全零的文件先找副本恢复，不用占位内容冒充已修复。\\n\\n## 提交顺序\\n\\n1. 用具体路径暂存，核对 diff，不夹带无关文件、截图和凭据。\\n2. 最深层子模块先提交并在需要时推送，确认远程已有该提交，再更新父仓库 gitlink，直到最外层。\\n3. 不强制推送、不重置、不丢弃他人改动。失败时保留已完成结果并报告阻碍。\\n4. 只有相关仓库都已提交，且要求推送时均已与远程同步，才能说提交推送完成。仅要求提交时，不把未推送说成失败，也不要声称已推送。\\n</skill_instructions>\\n</skill_content>\"}]", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_3cdf6fba66c5400b9e027ee28d4adfea", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 995, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-15T06:38:45.765Z", "peer_id": "github.com-tyvt-financial-data-lake"}
{"id": "msg_e4da94f7a0514a569669c23220aebc86", "role": "assistant", "parts": [{"type": "text", "text": "我会用 `worktree-snapshot` 清点仓库和现有工作树，并按 `repo-safety` 逐路径暂存与提交。目标脚本里有先前的股息门槛改动，因此提交前会核对差异，避免把它们带进本次提交。"}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_dbc8ccd0cc284a1783f820d141abc183|fc_0f6b75bc0f6fbdc9016af95380245087d2841f314a78ccf114", "tool_name": "skill", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"name": "worktree-snapshot"}}], "created_at": "2026-11-15T06:38:56.746Z", "peer_id": "github.com-tyvt-financial-data-lake"}
{"id": "msg_5b586af0cc184062b8c4a5f47d25031e", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_dbc8ccd0cc284a1783f820d141abc183|fc_0f6b75bc0f6fbdc9016af95380245087d2841f314a78ccf114", "tool_name": "skill", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"<skill_content name=\\\"worktree-snapshot\\\">\\n<skill_resources>\\nBase directory for this skill: C:\\\\Users\\\\Administrator\\\\.dsh\\\\skills\\\\worktree-snapshot\\nResolve relative paths mentioned by this skill against the base directory before using them. Load referenced resources only as needed.\\n</skill_resources>\\n\\n<skill_instructions>\\n# worktree-snapshot\\n\\n跑一次，不要自己拼 `git status` / `git worktree list` / `@{u}` / `head` / `tail`。\\n\\n```powershell\\npwsh -File D:\\\\repository\\\\skills\\\\worktree-snapshot\\\\scripts\\\\snapshot.ps1 -Repo <父仓或子模块根>\\n```\\n\\n每行：`<worktree> | <branch 或 DETACHED> | dirty=<n> | <HEAD 短哈希>`。\\n\\n判读：\\n\\n- 显示分支名的那一行才是该分支的检出位置。主检出是 `DETACHED` 时，改动落在分支所在的 worktree，不要改主检出。\\n- 这份输出是本轮开工快照。后续只查刚改过的路径，不重复跑全量 `git status`。\\n</skill_instructions>\\n</skill_content>\"}]", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_5b586af0cc184062b8c4a5f47d25031e", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 802, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-15T06:38:56.769Z", "peer_id": "github.com-tyvt-financial-data-lake"}
